{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46975","headline":"寄武陵贯微上人二首 二 · 齐己","name":"寄武陵贯微上人二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴头东面楚西边，云接苍梧水浸天。\n两地别离身已老，一言相合道休传。\n风骚妙欲凌春草，踪迹闲思遶岳莲。\n不是傲他名利世，吾师本在雪山巅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46975.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46975","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}